sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant A as API
  participant D as DB
  U->>W: open page
  activate W
  W->>A: GET /items
  activate A
  loop every row
    A->>D: select
    activate D
    D-->>A: row
    deactivate D
    Note over A,D: cached
  end
  alt hit
    A-->>W: 200
  else miss
    A-->>W: 404
    Note right of W: retry later
  end
  par fan out
    A->>A: self call
  and
    A-)D: async
  end
  opt debug
    W--xU: trace
  end
  deactivate A
  W-->>U: done
  deactivate W
